# Build context for os/Dockerfile is the repo root. Keep build outputs and dev
# environments out of it: out/ holds the multi-GB rootfs.tar and ISO, and a
# host .venv (x86-64 wheels) would otherwise be copied into the i386 image
# through `COPY app/ /opt/rocola/`.
.git
out/
build/
dist/
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.egg-info
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
app/tests/
app/uv.lock
app/.python-version
.github/
